Hold {lb} for the weapon ring, aiming with the right stick {rs}. {up} and {down} step through your weapons. {rb} changes fire mode; hold {rb} to talk on voice chat (V).
Hold {select} for the scoreboard. To chat, open the on-screen keyboard with {guide} + {west} and press Y (all) or U (team).
Servers: BattlEye was removed from the game in December 2025, and VAC sees the pad as an ordinary keyboard and mouse. Don't use the game's {i}exec controller{/i} config at the same time: the two would fight.
These keys are written from memory and not checked in the game (walk, fire mode, prone and voice especially). Compare them with Options → Controls and change the buttons here to match. The gyro's real-world turn assumes a mouse sensitivity of 3; set the full turn to 16364 divided by your sensitivity.'''

